It's certainly worthwhile doing a search for nethack on freshmeat.net.
It's a web portal for sourceforge and as a result is pretty much the
best way I've found to find open source software. A quick search yielded
me 21 different packages. In particular, nethack records has potential
for your use. 

Amazing: there's a version of nethack that runs *in* emacs.

You can also go directly to sourceforge.net and do a search there. You might
get more results.


